## Auto-refreshed Data
//@ [] 00:40

```plotly
{
   data: [{
       x: [1, 2, 3, 4],
       y: [Math.random(), Math.random(), Math.random(), Math.random()],
       type: 'scatter'
   }],
   repeat: 500  // Refresh every 500 milliseconds
}
```

